  function method() {
    main.innerHTML = `<article class="method"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="#board">All protocols</a><span>/ Method & assumptions</span></div><div class="kicker">REPRODUCIBLE BY DESIGN</div><h1>Evidence in. Assumptions exposed.</h1><p>One frozen DefiLlama snapshot, dated ${D.date}. No external enrichment, live prices, claimed points, launch dates or contract addresses. All ${rows.length} candidates record no token in that snapshot; that is an indexing fact, not proof of an unissued token.</p>
